{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013MyA1SkECC2skRH734tWpp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# shopfront\n2\t\n3\tA tiny order service used as the fixture for Junior-dev's headless runs. Customers place\n4\torders through `POST /orders`; the service checks stock, charges the card through the\n5\tpayment provider, and records the order. Orders are kept in `data/orders.json`.\n6\t\n7\tRun it with `python -m src.app`. It needs no database. You will recieve an email receipt\n8\twhen an order is placed.\n9\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"22e8cff9-cee5-4a55-8777-e14c756364cd","uuid":"e9caecd5-979f-474b-8869-9d2e5e613e79","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:51:01.429Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\godle\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\jd-live-1xrpo_jl\\project\\README.md","content":"# shopfront\n\nA tiny order service used as the fixture for Junior-dev's headless runs. Customers place\norders through `POST /orders`; the service checks stock, charges the card through the\npayment provider, and records the order. Orders are kept in `data/orders.json`.\n\nRun it with `python -m src.app`. It needs no database. You will recieve an email receipt\nwhen an order is placed.\n","numLines":9,"startLine":1,"totalLines":9}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013MyA1SkECC2skRH734tWpp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
